  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe user profile icons displayed on the VRC+ Leaderboard play a sound on howver, as well as on button up. This makes it feel like there should be something happening when clicking on them, but nothing does.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nThere are 2 way I could see this being solved:\n\n1. Remove the hover and button up sound effects to make them match the functionality.\n\n2. Add a hover animation + action when clicking on them, e.g. opening that users profile, to match the fictionality with the sound.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a small video showcasing the issue:",
